{
    "about": "Country pack CH: where a journal line's tax code lands on the ESTV VAT return form (effective method). Read per edition of the form: a rule maps a tax CATEGORY at a RATE to a form field (ADR-041, addendum 2026-11-24, point 5); a code entry is an exception for that one code while it carries the named category. Rates are hundredths of a percent (810 = 8.1 %); \"any\" maps every rate. A category and rate without a rule refuses the return. The field kind says how the field is computed (docs/topics/vat.md, «form mapping»).",
